sbx up — Create or start this worktree’s persistent sandbox

Usage:
  sbx up [--allow-stale] [--retry-bootstrap] [--json]

Requires a Git worktree with sbx.toml. Reuses an owned sandbox; never recreates it
or adopts an unowned one. Refuses Creation drift unless explicitly allowed.
Bootstrap runs after creation; incomplete initialization fails up and is not retried automatically.

Flags:
  --allow-stale      Allow Creation drift without recreating; does not bypass Image checks
  --retry-bootstrap  Explicitly rerun Bootstrap, including incomplete initialization
  --json             Write the result as JSON; check/Bootstrap progress goes to stderr
  -h, --help         Show this help and exit
